[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.2 System overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SVVP-001-MILUAV
TITLE: System Overview
STATEMENT: The Military Quad Copter RTOS requires comprehensive verification and validation for safety-critical, real-time, and secure military UAV operations.
RATIONALE: System overview provides context for V&V activities.

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: 1.3 Document overview

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SVVP-002-MILUAV
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: This document covers V&V organization, referenced documents, V&V activities, and V&V criteria per MIL-STD-498.
RATIONALE: Structured documentation supports effective V&V.

[[/SECTION]]

